---
import BlogLayout from "../../layouts/BlogLayout.astro"
---

<BlogLayout title="New Project Status">
  <header>
    <h1>New Project Status</h1>
    <p class="secondary">Published on June 15th, 2025</p>
  </header>
  <p>Hello everyone,</p>

  <p>
    I want to let you know that the API for this project will be shutting down
    next month.
  </p>

  <p>
    It's been a great journey building and maintaining this project. The first
    version of the browser extension (v1.0.0) was released exactly one year ago,
    on June 4th, 2024. Since then, I've been personally covering the monthly
    hosting costs to keep everything running.
  </p>

  <p>
    However, I believe it's time to move on and focus on new ideas and projects.
    While this was never a commercial endeavor, and there were no donations to
    help support it, I'm grateful for everyone who used and appreciated the
    work.
  </p>

  <p>
    So, what does this mean for you? Is this the end? Not quite. The extension
    will continue functioning, but with limitations. When the API goes offline,
    it will no longer receive updates — no new websites will be added or
    removed. At the time of writing, there are 618 blocklisted websites stored
    locally within the extension. These will continue to be blocked without
    relying on the server.
  </p>

  <p>
    Thank you all for your understanding, support, and for being part of this
    journey.
  </p>

  <p><em>— Nitrrine, Founder of the project</em></p>
</BlogLayout>
